### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks

### Get task by ID
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks/4

### Get task by completed
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks?completed=true

### Create a new task
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "Learn Spring Boot",
    "description": "Practice ResponseEntity"
}


### Create a new task with DTO
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks 
Content-Type: application/json 

{   
    "title": "Learn Validation", 
    "description": "Add @Valid to controller" 
}

### Create a new task with DTO with a empty title
POST http://localhost:8080/tasks 
Content-Type: application/json 

{ 
    "title": " ", 
    "description": "This should fail" 
    
}

### Update an existing task
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title" : "Study Spring Boot",
    "description" : "Practice ResponseEntity",
    "completed" : "true"
}

### Update an existing task with DTO validation
PUT http://localhost:8080/tasks/1 
Content-Type: application/json 

{ 
    "title": "Study Advanced Java &amp; Spring Boot", 
    "description": "Master DTOs and Validation",
    "completed" : true
}


### Delete an existing task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/tasks/999

### Verify deletion
GET http://localhost:8080/tasks